Z||000000||RobertVol||08-23-2000||12:29 AM||||I was watching the news tonight and I Know we have some South Florida guys in the Forum and thought hmmm<P>What do you guys do to protect your little toys when you have a risk like living down in South Florida? I myself live in a Condo Community but have no Garage so when Floyd Threatened last yr, I went all over for shelter for my cars. FORGET ME! just for my cars  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Gotta keep your priorities<P>Anyway I just thought I would mention this <P>If ever you guys need a place to store cars, we up here in the North Florida Fiero club would try to assist if God Forbid its ever needed. That more than likley could be said for the Central Florida club to. <P>Probably not this round but keep it in Mind. <P>Also if tracking Debby check oue site so youo can look at Fieros while tracking the storm!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/index.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/index.htm</A> <P><BR>MAN I MUST BE UP TO LATE!<P><P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT Top 3.8 SC t top <BR>88GT T top 55k for sale<BR>  <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A>  <BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/HTMLobj-1309/aniGif.gif"> ||||reg||12
